离开《办公室》后，他接着为《明迪烦事多》担任编剧。

151
00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:42.250
And, Angela, Charlie said that one of the main inspirations for this episode was to highlight Phyllis.
而且，安吉拉，查理说这一集的主要灵感来源之一就是为了突出菲莉丝。

152
00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.970
Charlie, you did it, and I love that you love Phyllis.
查理，你做到了，我太喜欢你对菲莉丝的偏爱了。

153
00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:52.130
Yeah, he said this was one of those situations where they wanted to do a storyline with an unusual pairing.
没错，他说这属于那种他们想要安排不寻常组合的剧情。

154
