You're so right.
你说得太对了。

162
00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:09.890
You're so right.
你说得太对了。

163
00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:16.390
Fast fact number two, this is the first episode that Jen Salata directed.
速查事实之二，这是詹·萨拉塔执导的第一集。

164
00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.630
Oh, Jen!
哦，詹！

