209
00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:20.450
I don't know.
我不知道。

210
00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:21.270
Did I pack underwear?
我带内衣了吗？

211
00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:21.730
I don't know.
我不知道。

212
00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.150
I don't know.
我不知道。

213
00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:22.570
Oh, my God.
噢，天哪。

214
00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:23.150
I got to get up.
我得起来。

215
00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:23.690
I got to go look.
我得去看看。

216
00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:28.490
I can't sleep the night before anything big.
任何重大事情的前一晚我都睡不着。

217
00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:29.150
All right.
好吧。

218
00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.790
