945
00:41:42.220 --> 00:41:48.420
Well, I got to see Bruce Springsteen live on Broadway when he did his Broadway show, and it was fantastic.
好吧，我有幸去百老汇现场看过布鲁斯·斯普林斯汀的百老汇演出，棒极了。

