00:56:09.980 --> 00:56:12.260
Basically, you know, she says, I'm really tired.
基本上，你知道的，她说，我真的很累。

1251
00:56:12.480 --> 00:56:13.940
I think I'm just going to go to bed early.
我想我还是早点睡吧。

1252
00:56:14.360 --> 00:56:15.960
Yeah, she's had a big week at school.
对，她在学校这一周可真够忙的。

1253
00:56:16.360 --> 00:56:16.620
Yeah.
是啊。

1254
00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:18.320
So, you know, fine.
